title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6 if next_election_time - time > 6 and not (year == 1928 and month == 1); rally_timer = 2 if (year == 1928 and month == 1) or (next_election_time - time <= 6)
card-image: img/protest.jpg
go-to: main_rally

@main_rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of <span style="color: #c00000;">social democratic</span> life, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @welfare: cost of living and welfare
- @feminism_rally: feminism/lgbtq
- @pacifism: Opposing war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs.
- @environment: environment
- @antifascism: antifascism
- @antimigration: antimigration
- @easy_discard

@welfare
on-arrival: econ_moderation -= 0.5; cdu_relation -= 1; urban_linke += ((issue_cost_of_living + issue_welfare + issue_services + unemployed/10)/3)*(1 - dissent); east_linke += ((issue_cost_of_living + issue_welfare + issue_services + unemployed/10)/4)*(1 - dissent); rural_linke += ((issue_cost_of_living + issue_welfare + issue_services + unemployed/10)/5)*(1 - dissent); issue_welfare += 0.2; issue_services += 0.2; issue_cost_of_living += 0.2;

@feminism_rally
view-if: oldleft_strength < 40 and social_moderation < 6
on-arrival: social_moderation -= 0.5; bsw_relation -= 2; youth_linke += (issue_feminism + (10-social_moderation)/5)*(1 - dissent); urban_linke += ((issue_feminism + (10-social_moderation)/5)/2)*(1 - dissent); rural_linke -= ((issue_feminism + (10-social_moderation)/5)/3); east_linke -= ((issue_feminism + (10-social_moderation)/5)/4); issue_feminism += 0.5; beweli_dissent -= 2; emali_dissent -= 2; oldleft_dissent += 3;

@antifascism
view-if: afd_vote >= 20
on-arrival: pro_status_quo += 2*(1 - dissent); youth_linke += (issue_antifascism - 1 + afd_votes/20 + solid)*(1 - dissent); urban_linke += (issue_antifascism - 1 + afd_votes/20)*(1 - dissent); east_linke += (issue_antifascism - 1 + afd_votes/25)*(1 - dissent); issue_antifascism += 0.5; spd_relation += 3; greens_relation += 3;

@pacifism
view-if: foreign_moderation < 10
on-arrival: foreign_moderation -= 0.5; pro_status_quo -= 1; youth_linke += (issue_antimilitarism + (cdu_votes + fdp_votes + afd_votes)/50)*(1-dissent); east_linke += (issue_antimilitarism + (cdu_votes + fdp_votes + afd_votes)/50)*(1-dissent); urban_linke += ((issue_antimilitarism + (cdu_votes + fdp_votes + afd_votes)/50)/2)*(1-dissent); bsw_relation += 1; issue_antimilitarism += 0.5;

@environment
view-if: social_moderation < 6
on-arrival: social_moderation -= 0.5; econ_moderation -= 0.5; bsw_relation -= 2; greens_relation += 3; youth_linke += (issue_environment+(10-social_moderation)/3)*(1-dissent); urban_linke += ((issue_environment+(10-social_moderation)/4)/3)*(1-dissent); issue_environment += 0.5; beweli_dissent -= 1; emali_dissent -= 1; oldleft_dissent += 3;

@antimigration
view-if: social_moderation >= 6 and oldleft_strength > 45
on-arrival: bsw_relation += 4; greens_relation -= 3; rural_linke += (social_moderation/5 + issue_migration)*(1-dissent); east_linke += ((social_moderation/5 + issue_migration)/1.5)*(1-dissent); youth_linke -= (social_moderation/5 + issue_migration)/2; urban_linke -= (social_moderation/5 + issue_migration)/3; social_moderation += 0.5; issue_migration += 0.5;
